    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Epic Boon Feat (Prerequisite: Level 19+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 30.</p><p><strong>Gaseous Form.</strong> If you drop to 0 Hit Points but aren't killed outright, you can instead drop to 1 Hit Point and cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGaseousFor]{Gaseous Form} without a spell slot (no action required). Cast this way, it can target only you, your Fly Speed is 20 feet, and you regain 10 Hit Points at the start of each of your turns for the spell's duration. Its spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-ZJIjzZZC6fCB15Lg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Set yourself to 1 Hit Point and cast the granted Gaseous Form without a slot on yourself; <em>Misty Recovery</em> heals the 10 Hit Points each turn.</p></section>",
